@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Employee
participant ":System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : requests to buy a train
    activate System

        System --> Employee : displays list of avaible locomotives(filtred by scenario and date
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects a train(shop)
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows information about train (i.e. type, price, current date)
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : confirms purchsase
    activate System

        System --> Employee : generate unique id for train
    deactivate System

note right of System
There is no logical limit to the number of locomotives,\n
 only the available memorySystem"
end note


        System --> Employee : confirms purchase and displays succes message
    deactivate System
@enduml